  {
   "rating": 32,
   "date": "2006-06-07T14:38:22-05:00",
   "body": "A camp of them can be found at:\n\n24, 31\n\nMake a macro with this:\n\n/script px,py=GetPlayerMapPosition(\"player\")\n/script DEFAULT_CHAT_FRAME:AddMessage(format(\"[ %s ] %i , %i\",GetZoneText(),px*100,py*100)); \n\nIt will tell you your cords without having a mod installed.",
   "replies": [
    "great co-ords",
    "very nice macro"
   ]
  },
