  {
   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2006-02-18T02:38:22-06:00",
   "body": "?\n\nThat's not that far, and they are there.&nbsp; It's not east, it's on the western side man.&nbsp;",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2004-12-01T19:35:17-06:00",
   "body": "Or you can go west out of thelsmar (sp) and hit that little camp about 30 seconds out of town. They spread out a bit and are closer to the town in case you die",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2005-12-17T14:44:28-06:00",
   "body": "The drop rate for ears by higher level Tunnel Rats (Digger, Geomancer and Surveyor) are significantly lower.  So, stick with the low end Tunnel Rats (Tunnel Rat Scouts appear to have the highest drop rate).\n\nIn addition to the places mentioned below, Tunnel Rat camps on the western side of the road are also good places to hunt for the ears.\n\nEdited, Sat Dec 17 07:50:10 2005",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2006-07-14T02:38:22-05:00",
   "body": "a good place to do it is at (25,31)... that place took me about 10 mins to get all 12 ears.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2006-07-14T02:38:22-05:00",
   "body": "I did this one as a lvl 19 pally just for the heck of it, and it still took me a good half hour and about 40-50 kills for me to get all 12 ears.&nbsp; If your interested in a little bit more of a challenge, I'd say head over to Silver Stream Mine.&nbsp; You can also do another quest in here so you can knock out two for one.....",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2006-03-16T08:47:32-06:00",
   "body": "Yellow quest gave 875 experience.\nThere is a hut they roam around about 27, 38.  Very short walk North West of Thelsamar.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
